Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world is awash in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, wars are fought between spies\Nover information -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in shadow wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Time to decide who carries the backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Most common choice wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One, two, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Lily!\NYou said we'd choose rock together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You assholes all played me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:36.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You are the strongest one here, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The pack's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess when you put it like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gotten their jitters out, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have this bad feeling that just won't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like we're all making some sort\Nof horrible misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay, Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If something goes wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll put our heads together and come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Lily...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:15.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, Leader, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This battle is going to be Lamplight's big debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready to put\Ntheir intensive training to the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our infiltration routes will take us in\Nfrom the east and the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be operating separately from the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sample we're after is somewhere\Nin this building here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we weren't able to track down an exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to go to the mission site\Nand get that intel in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Abyss Doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the Empire stole a killer virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:02:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It spreads via airborne droplets over\Nits one-week incubation period,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then kills its host within twelve hours\Nof symptoms appearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.13,0:02:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing short of evil incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they think they can get away with using bioweapons,\Nthey've got another one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are a number of soldiers and\NImperial spies stationed on-site.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they find you,\Nthey'll shoot first and ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll need to deceive everyone\Nwho stands in your way to take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are three guards.\NThey're at range fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone was able to escape\NMr. Bernard's surveillance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's gotta mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...we're dealing with a spy, and a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spread out! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That bomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Its explosion was the same color\Nas the ones my mentor used to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Against him, I never once won a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:13.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He was always a tenth of a second faster than me,\Nand I could never close that gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:17.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,After Inferno got wiped out, I ID'd his corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:20.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But what if it was a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My idiot pupil was supposed to be\Nthe one coming in from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did he change his mind at the last minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Idiot pupil"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I take all seven of these kids hostage,\Nthat will be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're Teach's mentor, Mr. Guido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell? You know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Klaus has got some loose lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone on Inferno is supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He betrayed his team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always thought it was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impossible Mission or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it doesn't make sense for a team that legendary\Nto go down so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how did you know our infiltration route?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not the brightest, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was on Inferno,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I used to live in Heat Haze Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bugged the place to the gills myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it starting to make sense, little ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We heard everything through the wiretap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know everything about you seven,\Nand I know your entire plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we run, he'll just capture us one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead, we should take him on together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seven on one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:04:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we've got loads of practice fighting while outmatched!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wires, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,dumb or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember where you learned that trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Republic's spy techniques won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Six left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome to hell, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Blue Fly has made contact with enemy spies\Nby the western pipeline block.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then our information was accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our counterintelligence department\Nnever fails to impress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hostile coming from the east
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is heading straight for us here in the main building,\Njust as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He might not look it, but he's a total softie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's probably freaking out right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:06:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's thinking, "I can't afford to lose another team,"\Nor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, come on out.\NYou have ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For every second past that, I break one of her fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll use it to prepare our next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sure made up your mind quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was the wrong call, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should've abandoned your friend and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We decided that all seven of us\Nwould make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight wouldn't be Lamplight\Nwithout Teach and seven hotties like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A rainbow's got seven colors,\Nand there are seven deadly sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect number.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got me for greed, Thea for lust,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla for wrath-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who you callin' "Wrath"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She just had throw in that bit\Ncalling herself a hottie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having six or eight of us wouldn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The seven of us are all going to go back,\Ntogether with Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that'd make you "Lust," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to bait me, it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, you were too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is checkmate, Guido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You seriously thought that disguise would fool me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He always calls me "Master."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Five left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Four left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that, a paralyzing agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must have some sort of poison resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But so what?\N{\rSubtitle-3}We've got this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Three left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My poison didn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I held my breath as fast as I could,\Nbut it still stings like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See? I can barely feel my fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Run, Miss Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt my friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All that work you did this past month was for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Zero left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too bad, so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All that information you gathered was\Nbad intel we fed you on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be an Imperial spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Blue Fly, or as you knew him, Guido, turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And when he did, we got full dossiers\Non every spy the Din Republic has.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell you could beat us-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A trap? But when?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have some questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I expect answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured out what you're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Teach, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's been your target all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's the low-down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we took out Inferno two months ago,\Nthe plan was for him to die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gave him a special mission to\Nisolate him from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Him teaming up with the others\Nwould have been a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back then, I was being sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew that there was no way he was\Nmaking it out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then, imagine my surprise\Nwhen the little bastard pulled through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sent waves of top-notch Imperial spies after him,\Nand he put them all in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As far as the Empire's concerned,\Ngetting rid of him is a top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You used Abyss Doll as bait to lure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not even he's going to be able to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When he hears that, he'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how much he cares about his teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Faced with an opponent he can't beat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the disadvantage of having seven of his students\Ntaken hostage, he'll fight valiantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Teach comes, he'll die,\Nand if he doesn't, you'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Whatever will we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to ask, Mr. Guido...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How much longer should I keep\Nplaying along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just secured the Abyss Doll sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The mission is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:12:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All that's left for me to do is escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're about to head to the mission site,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but in all likelihood,  the Empire will be expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, that's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll go in pretending we're none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thinking we know nothing, our enemies will\Nunderestimate us and try to catch me in a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I can turn the tables on them\Nand secure the intel we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's our job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's one foe in particular I need you to deceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we're a diversion, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By feigning weakness, you can create an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your true mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the Abyss Doll sample and going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if I came over there, I can't beat you in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes more sense for me to prioritize the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're not here in five minutes-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you're working under a large misconception.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always suspected that one of Inferno's members\Nhad turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it was an inside job since the moment\NI heard the news two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was no proof.\NHow could you-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I had to give a reason, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it was because I found those bugs\Nyou planted in Heat Haze Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you found them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why the seven girls there and I\Noperated under the assumption
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that a traitor was listening to\Neverything we did in Heat Haze Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we first met, I gave them a set\Nof Communal Living Rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For example, one of them was as follows:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never use your unique talents\Ninside Heat Haze Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When the girls read the rules,\Nthey understood what I was getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From there, they spent the next month\Nfaithfully obeying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, Master, you think you know\Nwhat the girls are capable of,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the truth is, you know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dossiers you have on every\Nfull-fledged spy in the Republic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,won't do you a bit of good\Nagainst the academies' girl wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Each member of Lamplight has\Na deadly skill they keep hidden away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can say with full confidence that\Nthe girls will defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Flower Garden,\Nand it's time to bloom out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It smells so acrid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that foam what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This poison foam takes full advantage\Nof my abnormal physiology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I spent this past month coming up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you don't know a thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want to try it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You washouts still don't stand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why even bother getting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because it feels real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone who chose to betray the family\Nthey lived with in Heat Haze Palace never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for the others, and also...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's for the ideals Teach is still carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you down, Mr. Guido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was just for show?\NFigures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Klaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I took out all seven of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:36.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your students are all-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't just be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:57.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She was hiding in the white-haired kid's backpack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our first coordinated plan,\Nand I get stuck with the hardest job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was an eighth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The eight girls had to live\Nas if they were seven people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was one of the orders I gave them\Nvia the Communal Living Rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight's eighth member.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On the first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily and the rest of the original seven\Nwere the only ones who arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But on the morning of the second day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna showed up late and\Njoined the roster as its eighth member.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From that point on, they went about their lives\Nmaking sure never to mention
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that there were actually eight of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a trick built around the wiretap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing them in person would have made it obvious\Nthat there were eight of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's hard to tell eight girls apart\Nby their voices alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna specializes in misfortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and she's an expert when it comes to\Naccidents and disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her sharp senses let her subconsciously\Npick up on portents of doom,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,allowing her to get others caught up in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, but there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's our super secret ace in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many lies did you pile up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You seriously sacrificed a month of your lives\Njust to land a single attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just how far did you-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We seriously did.\NWe're your idiot pupil's pupils, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, we can leave the rest to Teach and-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But my stab landed, I know it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I even passed out for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My moves are a tenth of a second slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was all your efforts amounted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way! That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all we accomplished?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There you are, Idiot Pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Abyss Doll is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it all on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it\Nif you all hadn't distracted my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I might be a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead and take escape route four back to Din.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And like a fountain welling up from a plateau,\Nremember your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense, but you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was some excellent work my students did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your movements are a tenth of a second slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I finally caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky on me, Idiot Pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but in your current state,\Nyou aren't qualified to be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impossible Missions have\Na ninety percent mortality rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but us eight Lamplight girls made it through ours\Nwithout losing a single member.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, a week later...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, the eight of them\Nall went back to their academies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight was a provisional team assembled\Nto complete a single Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that the mission's over,\Nit makes sense to disband the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They won't have to self-deprecatingly\Ncall themselves washouts anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they can go forward with their heads held high,\Nthen I could ask for nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You almost sound like a real teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As an instructor, I was incompetent from start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what your mentor\Nwould have to say about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What became of Guido's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sadly, this is all I was able to\Nbring back with me from the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you betray Inferno, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,End it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finish the job, Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be disbanding Lamplight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of us can rebuild Inferno together, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can atone for what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,by putting your life on the line\Nfor the country we all love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only family I have left, Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're too soft, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that a sniper scope just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure you protect 'em this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Who was it?\NWho took the shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We finally caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be back at your academies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:11.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because we're spies, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At long last, our victory is at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, we can make whatever demands we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.21,0:22:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you even have to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We want Lamplight to stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all talked it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And, um, instead of going back to\Nour academies, graduating,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and getting stuck on teams with a bunch of strangers...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...we figured we would rather stick with the people\Nwe'd already been in the foxhole with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You could have just asked normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why bother tricking me, locking me up,\Nand holding me at gunpoint?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.71,0:22:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're just continuing your lesson plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.46,0:22:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That class has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Call it payback, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You surrender, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We want to keep learning from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.79,0:22:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach us how a bunch of former washouts\Ncan come into bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.29,0:23:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure you protect 'em this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.21,0:23:15.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.58,0:23:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't qualified to be my enemies yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then for all seven of you on Lamplight,\Nclass is back in session.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All eight, I should say.
